{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13467","headline":"蝉鸣一篇五章 一 · 宋华","name":"蝉鸣一篇五章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉其鸣矣，於彼疎桐。\n庇影容迹，何所不容。\n嘒嘒其长，永托于风。\n未见君子，我心仲仲。\n既见君子，乐且有融。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13467.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13467","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}